  "start_date_sort": "1264-07-01",
  "comments": "The work contains two parts, entitled respectively \"bslab btus kyi bsgom don dpe'i khrid zab po\" and \"spyod 'jug 'khor lo lta bu'i lam mdor bsdus pa.\"\r\nAccording to the post-colophon lineage found in (ID:4840), the work reports a teaching transmitted in a lineage starting with Maitreya, down to sKyo ston (ID:4052), and written down in the course of its transmission to Chos kyi rgyal mtshan (ID:6458).\r\nThe colophon of the second part names the author \"lha btsun pa,\" which may refer to sKyo ston.",
  "alternative_names": "spyod 'jug 'khor lo lta bu'i lam mdor bsdus pa",
